                                "sense_id": "c8da3ba9-ff35-3f57-99f6-5d0633256780",
                                "text": "So good dental hygiene, with regular periodontal cleanings, can help protect your heart as well as your teeth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfb68c23-3ae8-4ea4-9305-8d21e05c930c",
                                "sense_id": "c8da3ba9-ff35-3f57-99f6-5d0633256780",
                                "text": "Like me, it's old, slow, loud, unsophisticated, underpowered, and in bad need of a good cleaning ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
